DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
3931::$$$message_0029_0000_0000$$$::"...Whew."[lr]::
3932::$$$message_0029_0000_0001$$$::I pause, surrounded by salvage in the shed.[lr]::
3933::$$$message_0029_0000_0002$$$::It's nice and cool. The smell of grease and metal calms my nerves.[lr]::
3934::$$$message_0029_0000_0003$$$::"Oh yeah, the VCR. About time I get to that..."[lr]::
3935::$$$message_0029_0000_0004$$$::Just as I began to rummage around again...::
3936::$$$message_0029_0001_0000$$$::"AAAAAAAHHHHHHH!"[lr]::
3937::$$$message_0029_0001_0001$$$::I hear a distant scream.[lr]::
3938::$$$message_0029_0001_0002$$$::...It came from far away.[lr]::
3939::$$$message_0029_0001_0003$$$::That wasn't Sakura's voice, meaning it was either Fuji-nee, Saber, Rider, or... Anyway, it should be fine.::
3940::$$$message_0029_0002_0000$$$::"...I have a feeling this thing isn't viable."[lr]::
3941::$$$message_0029_0002_0001$$$::I wipe the dust off the deck cover.[lr]::
3942::$$$message_0029_0002_0002$$$::Even if I had a service manual, this is way beyond my ability to fix.[lr]::
3943::$$$message_0029_0002_0003$$$::Of course, lately everything has become so modular that it's difficult for amateur hobbyists to get a hold of them.::
3944::$$$message_0029_0003_0000$$$::"I'm surprised it still works even with the loader broken."[lr]::
3945::$$$message_0029_0003_0001$$$::This looks like it could take a while. I spread out my tools and organize my sheet.[lr]::
3946::$$$message_0029_0003_0002$$$::Now to take another look inside...[lr]::
3947::$$$message_0029_0003_0003$$$::"..."::
3948::$$$message_0029_0004_0000$$$::I feel a storm coming.[lr]::
3949::$$$message_0029_0004_0001$$$::Like an air pressure drop bringing in clouds overhead, and winds blowing the wrong way.[se storage=se271.wav][lr]::
3950::$$$message_0029_0004_0002$$$::I hear footsteps shaking the earth...[lr]::
3951::$$$message_0029_0004_0003$$$::"..."::
3952::$$$message_0029_0005_0000$$$::And they're headed straight for the shed.[lr]::
3953::$$$message_0029_0005_0001$$$::It's clear from a glance that it's Tohsaka, but the vortex of magical energy is a living typhoon.::
3954::$$$message_0029_0006_0000$$$::"Hey, Tohsaka."[lr]::
3955::$$$message_0029_0006_0001$$$::I wave in greeting.[lr]::
3956::$$$message_0029_0006_0002$$$::"......"[lr]::
3957::$$$message_0029_0006_0003$$$::She glares at me like I killed her parents.[lr]::
3958::$$$message_0029_0006_0004$$$::What on earth happened?[lr]::
3959::$$$message_0029_0006_0005$$$::It feels like she could unleash Gandr and kick off the "Murder in the Emiya Shed" case at any moment.::
3960::$$$message_0029_0007_0000$$$::"...You know the toilet?"[lr]::
3961::$$$message_0029_0007_0001$$$::"Which one? In the main building?"[lr]::
3962::$$$message_0029_0007_0002$$$::"The guesthouse."[lr]::
3963::$$$message_0029_0007_0003$$$::As we all know, this is a big place.[lr]::
3964::$$$message_0029_0007_0004$$$::There are restrooms in both the main house and the guesthouse.::
3965::$$$message_0029_0008_0000$$$::"Water was coming out."[lr]::
3966::$$$message_0029_0008_0001$$$::"There's a leak? Uh oh."[lr]::
3967::$$$message_0029_0008_0002$$$::A plumbing problem could cause a lot of damage if left alone.[lr]::
3968::$$$message_0029_0008_0003$$$::I should fix it. Pretty sure I have some sealant and gaskets on hand...::
3969::$$$message_0029_0009_0000$$$::"No."[lr]::
3970::$$$message_0029_0009_0001$$$::"It isn't broken?"[lr]::
3971::$$$message_0029_0009_0002$$$::I'm starting to feel very uneasy about Tohsaka's curt answers.[lr]::
3972::$$$message_0029_0009_0003$$$::It's like I'm looking at a dam that's about to burst.::
3973::$$$message_0029_0010_0000$$$::"...What was [font italic=true]that[font italic=false], Shirou?"[lr]::
3974::$$$message_0029_0010_0001$$$::"What's what? Wait, do you mean..."[lr]::
3975::$$$message_0029_0010_0002$$$::Come to think of it the guesthouse is a Western-style building, so I think it had some construction done to the facilities.[lr]::
3976::$$$message_0029_0010_0003$$$::And while Tohsaka was out, I had a state-of-the-art toilet seat installed...::
3977::$$$message_0029_0011_0000$$$::"Are you talking about the electronic bidet?"[lr]::
3978::$$$message_0029_0011_0001$$$::"Why didn't you tell me about that!?"[rf][lr]::
3979::$$$message_0029_0011_0002$$$::Annnd the dam burst.[lr]::
3980::$$$message_0029_0011_0003$$$::Like an idiot, I try to stand my ground against the overwhelming torrent.::
3981::$$$message_0029_0012_0000$$$::"You should've explained to me right away if you installed something like that! It isn't something like air freshener!"[lr]::
3982::$$$message_0029_0012_0001$$$::"Sorry, it slipped my mind.[lr]::
3983::$$$message_0029_0012_0002$$$::I never use that restroom, so[line len=2]"::
3984::$$$message_0029_0013_0000$$$::"ALL THE MORE REASON TO! I almost had a heart attack!"[wshock][lr]::
3985::$$$message_0029_0013_0001$$$::So that's what the scream was about...::
3986::$$$message_0029_0014_0000$$$::"...Yeah. The first time I used one was how I imagine it is going to the dentist. Well, I've never been to the dentist, but it made me grit my teeth, y'know?[lr]::
3987::$$$message_0029_0014_0001$$$::Still, Tohsaka. Once you get used to it, you'll see how convenient the comforts of civilization have made our lives."[lr]::
3988::$$$message_0029_0014_0002$$$::Sakura also said, "That was incredible, it surprised me." Seems like everyone wants to share their first experience with it.::
3989::$$$message_0029_0015_0000$$$::"Nobody asked your impression of it!"[lr]::
3990::$$$message_0029_0015_0001$$$::"Was that your first time using one, Tohsaka?"::
3991::$$$message_0029_0016_0000$$$::"Obviously. I never even imagined something like that existed![lr]::
3992::$$$message_0029_0016_0001$$$::It's inconceivable. Who in the world thought of such a barely appropriate idea!?[lr]::
3993::$$$message_0029_0016_0002$$$::Tch. Can't underestimate engineers these days. That kind of creativity and skill, are they gods or devils, or...!"::
3994::$$$message_0029_0017_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
3995::$$$message_0029_0017_0001$$$::Her metaphors are out of control.[lr]::
3996::$$$message_0029_0017_0002$$$::The bidet must have really given Tohsaka a shock.[lr]::
3997::$$$message_0029_0017_0003$$$::...Well, given that she doesn't seem to have one at home and how tech-illiterate she is, it must have been extremely alarming in the moment.::
3998::$$$message_0029_0018_0000$$$::"By the way, which button did you push first?"[lr]::
3999::$$$message_0029_0018_0001$$$::"H-how could you ask me something so embarrassing!? While grinning too!"::
4000::$$$message_0029_0019_0000$$$::"What ticks me off is[cacheimage storage=凛私服07c腕b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服07c腕b(中) textoff=0] that you kept that machine a secret from me [cacheimage storage=凛私服07c腕a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=400 storage=凛私服07c腕a(中) textoff=0]so you could make fun of me for it!"[lr]::
4001::$$$message_0029_0019_0001$$$::Yes, ma'am. Sorry, ma'am.[lr]::
4002::$$$message_0029_0019_0002$$$::I didn't mean to do that at all, even if it turned out that way.::
4003::$$$message_0029_0020_0000$$$::"Ha ha ha.[lr]::
4004::$$$message_0029_0020_0001$$$::Anyway, you should take full advantage of it to your heart's content. Sadly, we don't have one in the Japanese-style main building."::
4005::$$$message_0029_0021_0000$$$::"Who needs to use a [font italic=true]toilet[font italic=false] to her 'heart's content'!?[lr]::
4006::$$$message_0029_0021_0001$$$::Wait, it's only in the guesthouse restroom?"::
4007::$$$message_0029_0022_0000$$$::I nod.[lr]::
4008::$$$message_0029_0022_0001$$$::I've seen Japanese-style bidets on TV. Sadly, they're no longer manufactured for various reasons.::
4009::$$$message_0029_0023_0000$$$::"Hmm. Who else has used it, then?"[lr]::
4010::$$$message_0029_0023_0001$$$::"Sakura and Rider. Rider wasn't surprised or interested at all.[lr]::
4011::$$$message_0029_0023_0002$$$::Fuji-nee said she's used them before, too."::
4012::$$$message_0029_0024_0000$$$::"I see... Hehehe..."[lr]::
4013::$$$message_0029_0024_0001$$$::...She's clearly plotting something.[lr]::
4014::$$$message_0029_0024_0002$$$::And the victim can only be the last, unnamed resident.[lr]::
4015::$$$message_0029_0024_0003$$$::Tragedy breeds tragedy. I need to nip this chain of sadness in the bud...!::
4016::$$$message_0029_0025_0000$$$::"Saber, huh? ...Nice, that could be fun."[lr]::
4017::$$$message_0029_0025_0001$$$::"I knew it! Tohsaka wait, slow down[line len=2]"::
4018::$$$message_0029_0026_0000$$$::"I didn't say anything, though? You seem to have enjoyed this so much, it's only fair I get to have a little fun, too.[lr]::
4019::$$$message_0029_0026_0001$$$::Besides, I'm only going to tell Saber 'Try pushing that button.'"[lr]::
4020::$$$message_0029_0026_0002$$$::...So she's chosen the path of carnage.[lr]::
4021::$$$message_0029_0026_0003$$$::There's nothing I can do to stop [wm canskip=0][move time=200 path=(167,78,255)(-57,72,255)(-48,95,255)(-173,73,255)(-421,75,255)(-412,95,255)(-537,73,255) storage=凛私服05f(中) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0]Tohsaka from skipping away.::
4022::$$$message_0029_0027_0000$$$::...I go back to fiddling with the VCR for a few more minutes.[lr]::
4023::$$$message_0029_0027_0001$$$::"HEEEEEEYEEAAAAARGH!?"[lr]::
4024::$$$message_0029_0027_0002$$$::...Saber's scream. What a rare treat, indeed.[lr]::
4025::$$$message_0029_0027_0003$$$::Another [se storage=se271.wav]tempest looms, so I'd better take some typhoon precautions while I can.::
903973::$$$message_9029_0010_0000$$$::"...What was <fzitalic>that</fzitalic>, Shirou?"[r]::

